(7473873, 1187121, 140305, '<td valign="top">nicely done, makes me want to book a holiday :)</td>', 'nicely done, makes me want to book a holiday :)', '2016-09-12 02:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473876, 1187229, 140305, '<td valign="top">OK, maybe I''m jealous...wow!</td>', 'OK, maybe I''m jealous...wow!', '2016-09-12 02:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473877, 1187072, 140305, '<td valign="top">sugar in the evening...</td>', 'sugar in the evening...', '2016-09-12 02:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473911, 1187400, 114285, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous scenery, love all the boats and the fortress!</td>', 'Gorgeous scenery, love all the boats and the fortress!', '2016-09-12 10:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473912, 1186824, 114285, '<td valign="top">Totally stunning image! Loving the clouds and the reflections!</td>', 'Totally stunning image! Loving the clouds and the reflections!', '2016-09-12 10:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473913, 1187444, 114285, '<td valign="top">A bit over the top, but I like it!</td>', 'A bit over the top, but I like it!', '2016-09-12 10:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473914, 1187430, 114285, '<td valign="top">Them clouds, WOW, they look 3 D!!!  I like the fact that there''s basically only three clolours in this image, very well done overall.</td>', 'Them clouds, WOW, they look 3 D!!!  I like the fact that there''s basically only three clolours in this image, very well done overall.', '2016-09-12 10:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473941, 1187447, 163081, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. That deep blue sea contrasting the white sails simply makes it. I don''t know why there are vertical lines in the sky. A 9 from me</td>', 'Very nice picture. That deep blue sea contrasting the white sails simply makes it. I don''t know why there are vertical lines in the sky. A 9 from me', '2016-09-12 14:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473942, 1187303, 163081, '<td valign="top">solid, liquid, vaporized. A little dark processed. Great picture, 8 from me</td>', 'solid, liquid, vaporized. A little dark processed. Great picture, 8 from me', '2016-09-12 14:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473955, 1187229, 70393, '<td valign="top">Without hesitating I chose 10 for this photo</td>', 'Without hesitating I chose 10 for this photo', '2016-09-12 19:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473958, 1187374, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good basic golden hour image - crisp and sharp. A little on the empty space side which doesn''t help any, but neither does it seriously detract from the image quality.</td>', 'A good basic golden hour image - crisp and sharp. A little on the empty space side which doesn''t help any, but neither does it seriously detract from the image quality.', '2016-09-12 20:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473959, 1187433, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a great image - love the subdued coloration, but the overall impact is intriguing and allows you time to look at all the subtle detail and depth of field. A very worthy challenge entry.</td>', 'This is a great image - love the subdued coloration, but the overall impact is intriguing and allows you time to look at all the subtle detail and depth of field. A very worthy challenge entry.', '2016-09-12 20:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473960, 1187356, 101256, '<td valign="top">Well.....I honestly don''t know what to say from the fractured Longfellow to - what ever this is. There is outside the box and then there is outside the box - we can often be too subtle in trying to make a visual impression of some abstract concept form a long dead poet. Still, it is an entry thus deserves consideration.</td>', 'Well.....I honestly don''t know what to say from the fractured Longfellow to - what ever this is. There is outside the box and then there is outside the box - we can often be too subtle in trying to make a visual impression of some abstract concept form a long dead poet. Still, it is an entry thus deserves consideration.', '2016-09-12 20:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473963, 1187379, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - very cold and menacing - almost Gothic in concept and execution.  Nothing really technical to complain about - very nice entry.</td>', 'Beautiful image - very cold and menacing - almost Gothic in concept and execution.  Nothing really technical to complain about - very nice entry.', '2016-09-12 20:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473964, 1187265, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very nice routine snapshot quality image - would have worked much better with a longer lens to capture more detail of the bridge.</td>', 'A very nice routine snapshot quality image - would have worked much better with a longer lens to capture more detail of the bridge.', '2016-09-12 20:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473965, 1187419, 101256, '<td valign="top">It just seems to me that this is lighter than it should be given the sky and water coloration. A little less exposure would help to give the foreground a little mystery and intrigue.</td>', 'It just seems to me that this is lighter than it should be given the sky and water coloration. A little less exposure would help to give the foreground a little mystery and intrigue.', '2016-09-12 20:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473966, 1187245, 101256, '<td valign="top">Indeed - it is a pond.  Pretty standard snapshot image with nothing in particular to recommend it but neither is there anything to damage it as a photograph. Just a standard snap.</td>', 'Indeed - it is a pond.  Pretty standard snapshot image with nothing in particular to recommend it but neither is there anything to damage it as a photograph. Just a standard snap.', '2016-09-12 20:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473967, 1187072, 101256, '<td valign="top">Crisp, clean and clear imagery with wonderful greens contrasting with the golden tones of sky and trees. Very nicely composed - good eye on the color and overall impact of the stream. A worthy entry.</td>', 'Crisp, clean and clear imagery with wonderful greens contrasting with the golden tones of sky and trees. Very nicely composed - good eye on the color and overall impact of the stream. A worthy entry.', '2016-09-12 20:39:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473968, 1187402, 101256, '<td valign="top">I spent more time looking at the interesting clouds than at the chairs themselves.  Then I looked at the chairs and found myself examining them closely.  Which means to me that this is a really good image with a lot to recommend it. Good solid entry.</td>', 'I spent more time looking at the interesting clouds than at the chairs themselves.  Then I looked at the chairs and found myself examining them closely.  Which means to me that this is a really good image with a lot to recommend it. Good solid entry.', '2016-09-12 20:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473969, 1187308, 101256, '<td valign="top">When you see an image like this, you hesitate to say something because - well frankly it''s just an image of empty space.  Admittedly its water, but - empty. Sorry.</td>', 'When you see an image like this, you hesitate to say something because - well frankly it''s just an image of empty space.  Admittedly its water, but - empty. Sorry.', '2016-09-12 20:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473970, 1187198, 101256, '<td valign="top">This looks like an artists concept drawing for fantasy movie set. I love the color and detail. If I were lord of DP Challenge this would win this challenge hands down.  What a great image. Well done.</td>', 'This looks like an artists concept drawing for fantasy movie set. I love the color and detail. If I were lord of DP Challenge this would win this challenge hands down.  What a great image. Well done.', '2016-09-12 20:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473971, 1187338, 101256, '<td valign="top">I flummoxed - seriously, I''m totally at a loss here. Finding something positive is difficult, but points given for a good idea - not so many points for execution.</td>', 'I flummoxed - seriously, I''m totally at a loss here. Finding something positive is difficult, but points given for a good idea - not so many points for execution.', '2016-09-12 20:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473972, 1187284, 101256, '<td valign="top">I am not a huge fan of the whole "flowing water" genre of photography, but the subtle light touch in this image is nicely done. The picture is a little on the pale side which creates a "blah" effect and the dark border at the top detracts from the overall image. Still, a decent entry.</td>', 'I am not a huge fan of the whole "flowing water" genre of photography, but the subtle light touch in this image is nicely done. The picture is a little on the pale side which creates a "blah" effect and the dark border at the top detracts from the overall image. Still, a decent entry.', '2016-09-12 20:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473973, 1187337, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little less height would have helped this a lot - nice image, good color,interesting texture on the water reflection - very nice entry.</td>', 'A little less height would have helped this a lot - nice image, good color,interesting texture on the water reflection - very nice entry.', '2016-09-12 20:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473974, 1187434, 101256, '<td valign="top">A great B&amp;W conversion - great shot, richly detailed, perfect tonal balance - a very worthy entry into the challenge.</td>', 'A great B&W conversion - great shot, richly detailed, perfect tonal balance - a very worthy entry into the challenge.', '2016-09-12 20:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473976, 1187032, 101256, '<td valign="top">A relaxing image - could have used a little better lighting to bring out a little more detail - maybe more exposure would have helped, but there are alot of little things about this that I like. The birds, the subtle light on the subject''s shoulder - a welcome peaceful image.</td>', 'A relaxing image - could have used a little better lighting to bring out a little more detail - maybe more exposure would have helped, but there are alot of little things about this that I like. The birds, the subtle light on the subject''s shoulder - a welcome peaceful image.', '2016-09-12 20:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473977, 1187377, 101256, '<td valign="top">I know what the submitter wanted to convey here, but it missed  by a mile. Way too much empty space detracting from the really interesting bird. A change in view would have help this a lot.</td>', 'I know what the submitter wanted to convey here, but it missed  by a mile. Way too much empty space detracting from the really interesting bird. A change in view would have help this a lot.', '2016-09-12 20:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473978, 1187310, 101256, '<td valign="top">Richly detailed, very competent composition, earth tones not over done - a very good entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Richly detailed, very competent composition, earth tones not over done - a very good entry into the challenge.', '2016-09-12 20:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473979, 1187335, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little more work on post processing wouldn''t have hurt this at all. Its just not an interesting image - no drama, details are subdued, it is an entry, but could have used more work.</td>', 'A little more work on post processing wouldn''t have hurt this at all. Its just not an interesting image - no drama, details are subdued, it is an entry, but could have used more work.', '2016-09-12 21:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473980, 1187302, 101256, '<td valign="top">I should really recuse myself from reflection shots. Its a good idea, but lacks in execution.  For a reflection shot to work, you have to have more than just a reflection - it has to be balanced with something firmer - just an image of a reflection without context is meaningless.</td>', 'I should really recuse myself from reflection shots. Its a good idea, but lacks in execution.  For a reflection shot to work, you have to have more than just a reflection - it has to be balanced with something firmer - just an image of a reflection without context is meaningless.', '2016-09-12 21:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473981, 1187300, 101256, '<td valign="top">Really really like this - not overly dark, but the impression of late evening is startling. Subtle coloration, water movement not over done - I''d like to see this win a top three slot if not win the challenge.</td>', 'Really really like this - not overly dark, but the impression of late evening is startling. Subtle coloration, water movement not over done - I''d like to see this win a top three slot if not win the challenge.', '2016-09-12 21:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473982, 1187250, 101256, '<td valign="top">This photograph works seemingly because of a simple little thing- the girl on the right with what can fairly be called a dance pose.  I don''t think the photographer even noticed it, but it makes the entire image more than just a snapshot and saves the over dark conversion from being an also ran. Accidental images are the best.</td>', 'This photograph works seemingly because of a simple little thing- the girl on the right with what can fairly be called a dance pose.  I don''t think the photographer even noticed it, but it makes the entire image more than just a snapshot and saves the over dark conversion from being an also ran. Accidental images are the best.', '2016-09-12 21:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473983, 1187351, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''m going to have to take a break after this one because I''m starting to get snarky in my comments. This is ok - a semi commercial image, a little washed out, nothing spectacular a good snapshot.</td>', 'I''m going to have to take a break after this one because I''m starting to get snarky in my comments. This is ok - a semi commercial image, a little washed out, nothing spectacular a good snapshot.', '2016-09-12 21:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473984, 1187364, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is an image of empty space that actually works. The variations of blue, the linear effect works perfectly against the level horizon. A very calm, pleasing image.</td>', 'This is an image of empty space that actually works. The variations of blue, the linear effect works perfectly against the level horizon. A very calm, pleasing image.', '2016-09-12 21:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473985, 1187447, 101256, '<td valign="top">I''ve spent a lot of years on the world''s oceans in another life and I''ve never seen water that color. Maybe a little over correction on the color scale?  In any case, these scenes are problematic in that you''re not seeing part of the action - this begs for an "action" shot which isn''t there.</td>', 'I''ve spent a lot of years on the world''s oceans in another life and I''ve never seen water that color. Maybe a little over correction on the color scale?  In any case, these scenes are problematic in that you''re not seeing part of the action - this begs for an "action" shot which isn''t there.', '2016-09-12 21:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473986, 1187293, 101256, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this is about. I think it would have worked better in the abstract sense if the foreground was reduced by a third to give the rest of the image a chance. As it is, it doesn''t really work.</td>', 'I have no idea what this is about. I think it would have worked better in the abstract sense if the foreground was reduced by a third to give the rest of the image a chance. As it is, it doesn''t really work.', '2016-09-12 21:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473987, 1187124, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it needs more action. The title should reflect what is happening and there isn''t a lot happening.</td>', 'I like it, but it needs more action. The title should reflect what is happening and there isn''t a lot happening.', '2016-09-12 21:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473988, 1187457, 101256, '<td valign="top">I like the tree actually. The rest of the image is so so.</td>', 'I like the tree actually. The rest of the image is so so.', '2016-09-12 21:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473989, 1187368, 101256, '<td valign="top">LOL!!!!!! I love it - yes it is a very cliche'' image. Well done. High score just for the sense of humor.</td>', 'LOL!!!!!! I love it - yes it is a very cliche'' image. Well done. High score just for the sense of humor.', '2016-09-12 21:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473990, 1187229, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nice snap shot - nothing more, nothing less.</td>', 'Nice snap shot - nothing more, nothing less.', '2016-09-12 21:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473991, 1187456, 101256, '<td valign="top">A clever title and a fun capture. Again, some clever titles can save what is a rather pedestrian image - nicely done.</td>', 'A clever title and a fun capture. Again, some clever titles can save what is a rather pedestrian image - nicely done.', '2016-09-12 21:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473992, 1187076, 101256, '<td valign="top">As I''ve often stated, I''m not a huge fan of the "flowing water" genre of imagery, but this actually works. Not overdone, fits perfectly into the landscape, lots of detail and color - a very worthy image in the challenge.</td>', 'As I''ve often stated, I''m not a huge fan of the "flowing water" genre of imagery, but this actually works. Not overdone, fits perfectly into the landscape, lots of detail and color - a very worthy image in the challenge.', '2016-09-12 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473993, 1187242, 101256, '<td valign="top">A little darker than it needs to be, but there is good detail. I''m just not getting the concept I guess.</td>', 'A little darker than it needs to be, but there is good detail. I''m just not getting the concept I guess.', '2016-09-12 21:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473995, 1187404, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is a case where green is not your friend. Greens are always difficult to properly reproduce and it is evident in this case. Might have been worth while to expose the image more or concentrate on the water rather than the green.</td>', 'This is a case where green is not your friend. Greens are always difficult to properly reproduce and it is evident in this case. Might have been worth while to expose the image more or concentrate on the water rather than the green.', '2016-09-12 21:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473996, 1187303, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice - great contrasts from the light and dark - great balance of tones - overall impression is excellent. Very well done - congratulations.</td>', 'Very nice - great contrasts from the light and dark - great balance of tones - overall impression is excellent. Very well done - congratulations.', '2016-09-12 21:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473997, 1187279, 101256, '<td valign="top">Just my opinion,but a reflecting pool scene shouldn''t be disrupted by other objects - in this case the ducks or birds or whatever they are. The color is great, the detail is nice, but the birds don''t to this image any favors.</td>', 'Just my opinion,but a reflecting pool scene shouldn''t be disrupted by other objects - in this case the ducks or birds or whatever they are. The color is great, the detail is nice, but the birds don''t to this image any favors.', '2016-09-12 21:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473998, 1187398, 101256, '<td valign="top">It is what it is. Nothing to recommend it - noting to look at - can''t really say more than that. Hate to be harsh, but why bother.</td>', 'It is what it is. Nothing to recommend it - noting to look at - can''t really say more than that. Hate to be harsh, but why bother.', '2016-09-12 21:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(7473999, 1187023, 101256, '<td valign="top">Certainly different, but this image begs for HDR treatment. The over powering color ruins the singular concept of morning relaxation.</td>', 'Certainly different, but this image begs for HDR treatment. The over powering color ruins the singular concept of morning relaxation.', '2016-09-12 21:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474000, 1187385, 101256, '<td valign="top">The subject should dominate the image and in this case it does. The color transition is stellar and truly different.  While the subject matter is rather pedestrian, the subtle detail and color changes make this a wonderful image. Well done.</td>', 'The subject should dominate the image and in this case it does. The color transition is stellar and truly different.  While the subject matter is rather pedestrian, the subtle detail and color changes make this a wonderful image. Well done.', '2016-09-12 21:36:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474001, 1187323, 101256, '<td valign="top">A snap shot, but not a snap shot. The image is a montage that compete for the viewer''s attention and not in a good way.</td>', 'A snap shot, but not a snap shot. The image is a montage that compete for the viewer''s attention and not in a good way.', '2016-09-12 21:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474002, 1187459, 101256, '<td valign="top">The best one can say is that there is a lot of competition here for the viewer to evaluate. Overly busy with no real subject.</td>', 'The best one can say is that there is a lot of competition here for the viewer to evaluate. Overly busy with no real subject.', '2016-09-12 21:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474003, 1187018, 101256, '<td valign="top">My view is that image should be simple. The fewer the elements in a photo, the stronger the statement the image makes. This is much to busy to have the subject of the push boat have any impact.</td>', 'My view is that image should be simple. The fewer the elements in a photo, the stronger the statement the image makes. This is much to busy to have the subject of the push boat have any impact.', '2016-09-12 21:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474004, 1187132, 101256, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus is one of the first things that viewers notice. In this case, sharper focus would have made this a very good entry, but the colors reduce the sharpness by a large factor.  A little more thought into this would have helped a lot.</td>', 'Sharp focus is one of the first things that viewers notice. In this case, sharper focus would have made this a very good entry, but the colors reduce the sharpness by a large factor.  A little more thought into this would have helped a lot.', '2016-09-12 21:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474005, 1187361, 101256, '<td valign="top">A good sound commercial stock image - not spectacular, but certainly competent.</td>', 'A good sound commercial stock image - not spectacular, but certainly competent.', '2016-09-12 21:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474006, 1187304, 101256, '<td valign="top">The tight side-to-side aspect of this image detracts from its over all impact. I suspect it was cropped to get the best water flow effect, but it has no context.</td>', 'The tight side-to-side aspect of this image detracts from its over all impact. I suspect it was cropped to get the best water flow effect, but it has no context.', '2016-09-12 21:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474007, 1187376, 101256, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that just begs to have a story written for it - probably a fantasy or perhaps a murder mystery. Very enjoyable image that allows for the imagination to make all sorts of odd connections.</td>', 'This is one of those images that just begs to have a story written for it - probably a fantasy or perhaps a murder mystery. Very enjoyable image that allows for the imagination to make all sorts of odd connections.', '2016-09-12 21:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474008, 1187367, 101256, '<td valign="top">I hate to say this, but this is an example of the "flow" effect gone horribly wrong. Not a worthy subject as the shoreline or sky would be.</td>', 'I hate to say this, but this is an example of the "flow" effect gone horribly wrong. Not a worthy subject as the shoreline or sky would be.', '2016-09-12 21:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474009, 1187430, 101256, '<td valign="top">Indeed - it is the Everglades. A good standard snap shot.</td>', 'Indeed - it is the Everglades. A good standard snap shot.', '2016-09-12 21:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474010, 1187437, 101256, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a subject that can try the viewer''s patience. Light should be used to its maximum potential to reveal what''s important in the image and to set the overall tone of the photo. Again,not to be hurtful, but this is an example of how not to expose an image with minimal lighting.</td>', 'Lighting is a subject that can try the viewer''s patience. Light should be used to its maximum potential to reveal what''s important in the image and to set the overall tone of the photo. Again,not to be hurtful, but this is an example of how not to expose an image with minimal lighting.', '2016-09-12 21:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474011, 1186630, 101256, '<td valign="top">Creative imagery can bring abstract concepts and ideas to the viewer. In this case, the attempt is a good one, but it falls short of being a Impressionist style effective image.</td>', 'Creative imagery can bring abstract concepts and ideas to the viewer. In this case, the attempt is a good one, but it falls short of being a Impressionist style effective image.', '2016-09-12 21:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474012, 1187121, 101256, '<td valign="top">Nice color and tone, the sun a little bloomy and over done - good quality snap shot for somebody to remember that day.</td>', 'Nice color and tone, the sun a little bloomy and over done - good quality snap shot for somebody to remember that day.', '2016-09-12 21:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474013, 1187312, 101256, '<td valign="top">This image needs severe color temperature correction.</td>', 'This image needs severe color temperature correction.', '2016-09-12 22:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474015, 1187027, 101256, '<td valign="top">Photos often rely on the "story" effect - in short, the image should tell a story or allow the viewer to create a suitable story to fit the image. Snap shots unfortunately are for photo albums and this is a good competent snapshot.</td>', 'Photos often rely on the "story" effect - in short, the image should tell a story or allow the viewer to create a suitable story to fit the image. Snap shots unfortunately are for photo albums and this is a good competent snapshot.', '2016-09-12 22:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474019, 1186824, 102315, '<td valign="top">Looks like another attempt at Lake Fog at Sunrise. One of my favorite photos on this site.</td>', 'Looks like another attempt at Lake Fog at Sunrise. One of my favorite photos on this site.', '2016-09-12 23:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474026, 1187402, 114285, '<td valign="top">Hmm I wonder who this is!!<br/> <br/>Love it, the clouds are spectacular and I love how the chairs are blowing in the breeze. Top stuff!</td>', 'Hmm I wonder who this is!! Love it, the clouds are spectacular and I love how the chairs are blowing in the breeze. Top stuff!', '2016-09-13 02:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474027, 1187319, 114285, '<td valign="top">Going for the most boring picture are you :-)</td>', 'Going for the most boring picture are you :-)', '2016-09-13 02:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474028, 1187385, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is really stunning love the tones that you''ve used!<br/> <br/> Perfect serenity, in my top picks.</td>', 'This is really stunning love the tones that you''ve used!  Perfect serenity, in my top picks.', '2016-09-13 02:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474032, 1187229, 114285, '<td valign="top">So so so beautiful, I love it!! <br/> <br/>The beautiful soft feel to this enhances the dreamy look of the image,  wonderfully composed also,  in my top picks!<br/> <br/> Edited for typo and punctuation :-)</td>', 'So so so beautiful, I love it!!  The beautiful soft feel to this enhances the dreamy look of the image,  wonderfully composed also,  in my top picks!  Edited for typo and punctuation :-)', '2016-09-13 04:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474034, 1187367, 114285, '<td valign="top">Man, talk about minimalistic beauty!!!! How stunning is this!! Such a unque perspective to the silky water typical image.<br/> <br/>Has to do well!<br/> <br/>All the best.</td>', 'Man, talk about minimalistic beauty!!!! How stunning is this!! Such a unque perspective to the silky water typical image. Has to do well! All the best.', '2016-09-13 09:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474039, 1187033, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice calm snap shot. Like the pilings and the detail something that the rest of the image lacks.</td>', 'A nice calm snap shot. Like the pilings and the detail something that the rest of the image lacks.', '2016-09-13 10:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474040, 1187383, 101256, '<td valign="top">Greens and low light do not make for a good image. Some back lighting or perhaps low level flash - even more exposure time would have made this a better image.</td>', 'Greens and low light do not make for a good image. Some back lighting or perhaps low level flash - even more exposure time would have made this a better image.', '2016-09-13 10:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474041, 1187355, 101256, '<td valign="top">Reflection images often are over done, but this is a good example of how to do it. Nice and crisp, sharp, interesting detail. One complaint is that the bottom third of the image could have been cut which would have improved it a lot.</td>', 'Reflection images often are over done, but this is a good example of how to do it. Nice and crisp, sharp, interesting detail. One complaint is that the bottom third of the image could have been cut which would have improved it a lot.', '2016-09-13 10:14:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474042, 1187444, 101256, '<td valign="top">And this is how you handle green and other color - what a wonderful capture - detailed, focused, brilliant colors - should be a top ten if not a ribbon winner.</td>', 'And this is how you handle green and other color - what a wonderful capture - detailed, focused, brilliant colors - should be a top ten if not a ribbon winner.', '2016-09-13 10:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474045, 1187169, 101256, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, richly detailed showing a way of life not many have ever seen. Very nice - well done - a top ten for sure.</td>', 'Beautiful image, richly detailed showing a way of life not many have ever seen. Very nice - well done - a top ten for sure.', '2016-09-13 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474047, 1186727, 101256, '<td valign="top">While this image is a whole lot of nothing, it conveys a sense of depth and distance that is remarkable. The detailing of the water''s surface and the very subtle cloud detailing is excellent. I really like this image. I''d vote for a top five finish for sure.</td>', 'While this image is a whole lot of nothing, it conveys a sense of depth and distance that is remarkable. The detailing of the water''s surface and the very subtle cloud detailing is excellent. I really like this image. I''d vote for a top five finish for sure.', '2016-09-13 10:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474048, 1187428, 101256, '<td valign="top">A case for "a little off the top" - maybe a third of the top of this image could be removed without impacting the image at all - in fact it would improve it tremendously.</td>', 'A case for "a little off the top" - maybe a third of the top of this image could be removed without impacting the image at all - in fact it would improve it tremendously.', '2016-09-13 10:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474049, 1186970, 101256, '<td valign="top">A very intriguing image - I like the HDR effect (not sure if it is HDR - it has aspects of being an HDR image), but a very effective image. There is a little bit of perspective magic happening on the right with the curve in the beach - it almost looks like a wave curling over - interesting. A solid entry.</td>', 'A very intriguing image - I like the HDR effect (not sure if it is HDR - it has aspects of being an HDR image), but a very effective image. There is a little bit of perspective magic happening on the right with the curve in the beach - it almost looks like a wave curling over - interesting. A solid entry.', '2016-09-13 10:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474050, 1187373, 101256, '<td valign="top">I suspect the photographer was going for a "dramatic" look, but it is much too dark - more exposure would have helped this - there is more detail in the back of the image than in the fore front of the image.</td>', 'I suspect the photographer was going for a "dramatic" look, but it is much too dark - more exposure would have helped this - there is more detail in the back of the image than in the fore front of the image.', '2016-09-13 10:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474051, 1186824, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice, peaceful reflection shot that is several steps above the snapshot quality imagery. Richly detailed, good color balance, excellent capture of a peaceful moment.</td>', 'A nice, peaceful reflection shot that is several steps above the snapshot quality imagery. Richly detailed, good color balance, excellent capture of a peaceful moment.', '2016-09-13 10:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474052, 1187400, 101256, '<td valign="top">I know the title is Italian and acqua is water but I have no club as to what the rest is. Having said that, a good solid snapshot quality image, decent color, composition could be improved.</td>', 'I know the title is Italian and acqua is water but I have no club as to what the rest is. Having said that, a good solid snapshot quality image, decent color, composition could be improved.', '2016-09-13 10:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474053, 1187452, 101256, '<td valign="top">Too much dark too much light, not enough detail.</td>', 'Too much dark too much light, not enough detail.', '2016-09-13 10:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474054, 1187406, 101256, '<td valign="top">Lots of green handled competently, nice detail, conveys an interesting scene. Nice entry into the challenge.</td>', 'Lots of green handled competently, nice detail, conveys an interesting scene. Nice entry into the challenge.', '2016-09-13 10:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474055, 1187152, 101256, '<td valign="top">An excellent image of a snowy egret. Very well done.</td>', 'An excellent image of a snowy egret. Very well done.', '2016-09-13 10:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474056, 1187354, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is an interesting effect in that this image is almost 3D quality. When looking at this, the eye has to refocus on things like the bridge for instance after looking at the rocks. Very interesting effect. I like the blend of color and detail - a good solid entry into the challenge - perhaps a top ten.</td>', 'There is an interesting effect in that this image is almost 3D quality. When looking at this, the eye has to refocus on things like the bridge for instance after looking at the rocks. Very interesting effect. I like the blend of color and detail - a good solid entry into the challenge - perhaps a top ten.', '2016-09-13 10:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474057, 1187445, 101256, '<td valign="top">I truly appreciate the lighting effect here  - the sun is not over done, just on the edge of being blown out, the reflection off the quard post - the rays from the sun - a very pleasing and welcome entry into the challenge.</td>', 'I truly appreciate the lighting effect here  - the sun is not over done, just on the edge of being blown out, the reflection off the quard post - the rays from the sun - a very pleasing and welcome entry into the challenge.', '2016-09-13 10:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
