(7474059, 1187360, 101256, '<td valign="top">Very nice conversion, plenty of depth and interesting details. The only serious flaw is that the image has been over sharpened - look at the hills in the foreground and that while line that separates the water - that is a sign of too much sharpening which ruins the overall impact of the image.</td>', 'Very nice conversion, plenty of depth and interesting details. The only serious flaw is that the image has been over sharpened - look at the hills in the foreground and that while line that separates the water - that is a sign of too much sharpening which ruins the overall impact of the image.', '2016-09-13 10:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474060, 1187439, 101256, '<td valign="top">A nice simple standard stock snapshot quality image.</td>', 'A nice simple standard stock snapshot quality image.', '2016-09-13 10:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7474061, 1187256, 101256, '<td valign="top">There is a story in this image that is waiting to be told. The fisheye effect is fun and gives the image some character normally lacking in this type of image. Well done.</td>', 'There is a story in this image that is waiting to be told. The fisheye effect is fun and gives the image some character normally lacking in this type of image. Well done.', '2016-09-13 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
