(7474063, 1187401, 101256, '<td valign="top">The water "flow" effect is over done, but this is a great example of how to make it work with maximum impact. The rich detail, almost woven effect, is perfect and enhances the overall impact of a richly detailed image. This is a top three image if not the challenge winner.</td>', 'The water "flow" effect is over done, but this is a great example of how to make it work with maximum impact. The rich detail, almost woven effect, is perfect and enhances the overall impact of a richly detailed image. This is a top three image if not the challenge winner.', '2016-09-13 11:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
