(7474586, 1187367, 135744, '<td valign="top">Very unusual in a good way! Congrats! I really like this. Funnily enough you have taken it with a lens I was seriously considering as I seem to have no ultra-wide angle lens for my full frame and that lens gets amazing reviews.</td>', 'Very unusual in a good way! Congrats! I really like this. Funnily enough you have taken it with a lens I was seriously considering as I seem to have no ultra-wide angle lens for my full frame and that lens gets amazing reviews.', '2016-09-19 08:58:36.000000', NULL, 0),
